stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Bound
    Bound --> Retired: Execution end confirmed
    Retired --> Notice: Live row end tick
    Retired --> Retired: A new save generation becomes eligible
    Notice --> Retired: Delivery failed
    Notice --> Settle: Notice acknowledged and recorded
    Notice --> Settle: Receipt already recorded for this key
    Settle --> Retired: Settlement failed
    Settle --> Ended: Settlement succeeded
    Retired --> PriorGeneration: Restart
    Notice --> PriorGeneration: Restart
    Settle --> PriorGeneration: Restart
    Ended --> PriorGeneration: Restart
    PriorGeneration --> Bound: New actor and nonce
